%% SFTP Platform — Private B2B File Exchange

sequenceDiagram
    participant Partner as External Partner
    participant DNS as Private DNS
    participant PE as Private Endpoint
    participant ST as Storage Account (SFTP)
    participant LAW as Log Analytics

    Partner->>DNS: Resolve sftp.internal.acmecorp.com
    DNS-->>Partner: 10.3.240.x (PE IP)
    Partner->>PE: SFTP connect (port 22)
    PE->>ST: Forward via Private Link
    ST-->>Partner: Auth challenge (SSH key)
    Partner->>ST: Authenticated session
    Partner->>ST: PUT file to container
    ST->>LAW: StorageWrite / SFTP audit log
